{"id":"torrey:busy-bodies","source":"torrey","name":"Busy-Bodies","slug":"busy-bodies","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Fools are — Pr 20:3.","refs":[["Prov",20,3,20,3]]},{"text":"The idle are — 2Th 3:11; 1Ti 5:13.","refs":[["2Thess",3,11,3,11],["1Tim",5,13,5,13]]},{"text":"Are mischievous tale-bearers — 1Ti 5:13.","refs":[["1Tim",5,13,5,13]]},{"text":"Bring mischief upon themselves — 2Ki 14:10; Pr 26:17.","refs":[["2Kgs",14,10,14,10],["Prov",26,17,26,17]]},{"text":"Christians must not be — 1Pe 4:15.","refs":[["1Pet",4,15,4,15]]}],"refCount":7}
